                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. A teacher who is granted his/her request for an extension is not guaranteed the same position held at the time of leaving. The teacher's return will be based on the availability of jobs for which the teacher is qualified. In any event, the District shall not be compelled to return said teacher to a position prior to the beginning of a school year.",
            "block_bbox": [
